desc: Move the last line to the top
category: manual
par: 6
hint1: Cut the line, jump to the top, paste above
hint2: G goes to the last line, gg to the first; P pastes above the cursor
solution: GddggP
note: G jumps to the last line; dd cuts it; gg goes to the top; P puts it above line 1.
--- START ---
apple
banana
MOVE UP
--- GOAL ---
MOVE UP
apple
banana
--- END ---
